    "body": "I think I'd allow `contentnamespace`, but it'd have to match the patch target's namespace; otherwise patching fails and the template is inserted as a normal template. In certain cases the patch target's namespace is ambiguous, such as with `annotation-xml` and `mi`. In those cases having `contentnamespace` would always result in a non-match.",
