    "body": "Added Agenda+ to discuss how to go about thihs given #11397. Specifically, it seems like the issues with supporting SVG/MathML in `<template for>` are quite orthogonal to the ones with ordinary attached templates. I wonder if we can fix `<template for>` by applying the patch target's namespace, disallow RCDATA-like targets like style/title, and then introduce the inherited/explicit template namespace later when we've completed #11397.",
